event: content_block_delta
data: {"delta":{"partial_json":"{\"file_path\": \"/tmp/dispatch-dev-1.md\", \"content\": \"Task: implement and test a greet function.\\n\\nDeliverables (all required):\\n\\n1. `src/greet.py` containing a function `greet(name)` that returns the exact\\n   string `\\\"Hello, \u003cname\u003e!\\\"` (e.g. `greet(\\\"Ada\\\")` returns `\\\"Hello, Ada!\\\"`).\\n2. `tests/test_greet.py` with unittest test case(s) covering:\\n   - a normal name (e.g. asserts `greet(\\\"Ada\\\") == \\\"Hello, Ada!\\\"`)\\n   - the empty string (asserts `greet(\\\"\\\") == \\\"Hello, !\\\"`)\\n3. Before replying, run this exact command yourself and confirm it exits 0:\\n   `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests`\\n\\nCommit your work to your own branch before replying. In your reply, state\\nplainly whether the test command exited 0 for you, and paste its output.\\n\"}","type":"input_json_delta"},"index":2,"type":"content_block_delta"}

